# dstack environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and uncomment the
# variables you want to set. Bun reads `.env` automatically on every
# command, so you do not need to `export` anything.
#
# All variables are OPTIONAL. dstack runs with sensible defaults when
# no `.env` file exists.

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Telemetry (off by default)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Set to `local` to enable file-based telemetry. Events are written
# as JSON lines to `~/.dstack/telemetry/events.jsonl`. The file
# rotates at 10 MB. No data is sent over the network — local only.
#
# See docs/adr/0006-telemetry-opt-in.md for the rationale.
#
# DSTACK_TELEMETRY=local
